Some US states are not eligible for this study. The pre-screen will tell you straight away whether you qualify.

## Your data and your privacy

Your privacy matters to us, and we take steps to protect your personal information.

- **Your identity is protected:** Personal identifiers are de-identified before data is shared with our research client
    
