Your data is used only for the purposes outlined in your consent agreement.

## Payment

You are paid per **accepted** submission, once your upload has been reviewed. There is no hourly commitment.


### Role Details & Eligibility
• Commitment: Task-Based
• Eligible Locations: USA', '["Clinical Medicine", "Iphone Users: Earn Money For Sharing Your Fitness Data"]', '["Contribute specialized domain expertise in (US Only) iPhone Users: Earn Money for Sharing Your Fitness Data", "Collaborate with leading frontier AI research teams to evaluate and improve model reasoning", "Ensure strict adherence to quality benchmarks and high-accuracy reference guidelines"]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABoX8yFU3zRlBRS-lJBaPO?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
