We''re hiring proficient bilingual speakers (English & Dutch) based in Belgium to help make advanced AI models safer. You''ll apply your language fluency and cultural judgment to evaluate and strengthen how these models handle sensitive topics in Dutch as it is spoken in Belgium. No prior AI/ML experience is required — we''ll train you on the workflow.

