- Nice to have: reliable access to a color-accurate 4K/HDR display for pixel-level review.
- Ability to engage reliably for approximately 40 hours/week during weekdays.
- Strong written communication and the ability to turn color and editorial detail into precise language for captions and evaluation templates.

