Apply today and put your clinical expertise to work shaping the health models clinicians and patients will rely on.


### Role Details & Eligibility
• Expected Hours: 20 hrs/week
• Commitment: Hourly', '["Clinical Medicine", "Critical Care Physician"]', '["Contribute specialized domain expertise in Critical Care Physician", "Collaborate with leading frontier AI research teams to evaluate and improve model reasoning", "Ensure strict adherence to quality benchmarks and high-accuracy reference guidelines"]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABoWtwdnkg16LT79ZPDawT?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO jobs (id, title, company, category, location, type, experience, compensation, description, skills, responsibilities, status, created_at, updated_at, external_url) VALUES ('0e98eae9-28b8-5b35-bc23-f84474f57c2c', 'Customer Experience Operations (India)', 'Mercor', 'Coding', 'Remote (India)', 'Contract', 'Specialist / SME', '$35,000 - $50,000/yr', '**This is a full-time internal role at Mercor, open to candidates based in India only.** You will work directly as part of Mercor''s team.

