• Commitment: Full-Time', '["React", "Customer Success Engineer", "India"]', '["Investigate talent-reported issues end-to-end: reproduce bugs, identify root causes, and separate UX friction, model edge cases, and system defects."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABnOP9NgGZSJmIf4dF5rx2?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
