# 1\. Overview

Join a leading AI lab''s cutting-edge research team and help build foundational AI models for science from the ground up. We''re seeking talented Drug Discovery subject-matter experts (SMEs), including pharmacologists, DMPK / ADME scientists and toxicologists from pharma, biotech, contract research or academic settings, to bring deep, hands-on discovery expertise to the design and evaluation of advanced AI models for drug discovery.

