- In addition to English, **advanced (C1 or above) proficiency — speaking, listening, and writing — in at least one of the following languages:**
    
    - Spanish · Chinese (Mandarin) · Chinese (Cantonese) · Tagalog · Russian · Haitian Creole
        
    - Korean · Arabic · Portuguese · Polish · Japanese
        
    - Turkish · Italian · Ukrainian · Romanian · Finnish · French · Danish · Catalan · Hungarian · Czech · German · Bulgarian · Indonesian · Dutch
        
- **Minimum availability of 10 hours/week**
    

## Preferred Qualifications

- 5+ years of experience post-residency
    
- Familiarity with **Epic**
    
- Prior **AI/ML annotation or model evaluation** work experience, with strong performance reviews
    
- Experience documenting patient care in a language other than English
    

## Work Arrangement

- Remote, part-time — minimum 10 hours/week
    
- Flexible scheduling, designed around an active clinical practice


