• Commitment: Full-Time
• Eligible Locations: USA', '["LLM Evaluation", "Litigation", "Compliance", "Taxation", "Clinical Medicine"]', '["**Data QA and reviews:** Vet the quality of legal knowledge work tasks and model outputs \u2014 spotting missing behaviors, thin reasoning, and answers that read well but would not survive professional scrutiny."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABn_cm_oIN381KOgpHz7lE?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
