• Commitment: Full-Time
• Eligible Locations: USA', '["LLM Evaluation", "Compliance", "Toxicology", "Molecular Biology", "Clinical Medicine"]', '["**Data QA and reviews:** Vet the quality of pharmaceutical knowledge work tasks and model outputs, spotting missing behaviors, thin reasoning, unsupported efficacy or safety claims, and answers that read well but would not survive scientific or regulatory scrutiny."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABoBt8iAkrN7-29JFCOYBm?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
