• Commitment: Hourly', '["German", "Germany"]', '["Contribute specialized domain expertise in STEM Expert, German (Germany)", "Collaborate with leading frontier AI research teams to evaluate and improve model reasoning", "Ensure strict adherence to quality benchmarks and high-accuracy reference guidelines"]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABoTkaz5Hn7af0WfZLt7to?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
