• Eligible Locations: USA, CAN, GBR, IRL, DEU, FRA, NLD, ESP, PRT, ITA, POL, ROU, BGR, SVK, SVN, SRB, EST, TUR, ARE, EGY, JOR, IND, SGP, IDN, THA, JPN, AUS, NZL, BRA, MEX, COL, CRI, NGA', '["Compliance", "Software Engineer", "Retail Investing Platforms"]', '["Join one 45\u201360 minute remote interview at a time that works for you."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:48:50.407678Z', '2026-11-04T21:49:28.123610Z', 'https://work.mercor.com/jobs/list_AAABoWa5lPEq7jlqhxZNLqEJ?referralCode=2a6bc3e0-a5f7-40ad-95f3-1609d00a73a8');
