Approve or stop the agent at key steps
Screen record every attempt
Score each run on completion, quality, control issues, satisfaction, and time
Share clear written feedback on the agent experience

Who we’re looking forUS-based, with a Bachelor’s degree
Someone who already uses AI in daily life
2-3 years of experience, preferably in engineering, business management, or office/operations
Detail-oriented, great at following instructions and documenting each step
Clear written communication
Generalists welcome, domain experts preferred
No coding or AI background needed

Why you’ll like itGet paid to use the AI tools you already use
Work entirely from your phone, on your schedule
Have a direct say in how next-generation AI agents get built and improved

How the selection process worksApply
Complete the screening questions
Interview: 15-30 minutes max
Profile review: if everything looks good, we present you to the client
Onboarding: our Talent Ops team will contact you to get you started', '["ChatGPT", "Muse", "AI agents", "Attention to Detail", "Following Instructions", "Screen Recording"]', '["Apply verified knowledge in ChatGPT, Muse, AI agents to benchmark AI solutions", "Audit generative model outputs for technical and factual correctness", "Synthesize domain feedback and evaluation signals to improve model performance", "Collaborate with project coordinators to maintain high rubric adherence"]', 'open', '2026-10-24 01:12:47', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/82ba10ad-8dbd-49ce-bc11-a83b9bb2169f?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
