Familiarity with RAG, tool calling, model evaluation, or prompt engineering.
Contributions to open-source AI projects or personal AI applications.
Experience working in fast-paced, AI-first environments.

Compensation & Benefits Notice

The national pay range for this full-time position is base salary of $130,000 –$160,000 USD. All employees are eligible for equity compensation, and employees may also receive performance-based bonuses, dependent on role and subject to company policies. micro1 provides a comprehensive benefits package, including up to 100% reimbursement for health-insurance premiums, paid time off, a 401(K) plan with a company match, and additional benefits designed to support a high-performing, remote-first workforce.

micro1 is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, sexual orientation, or gender identity), national origin, age, disability, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable local laws, regulations and ordinances. If you need assistance and/or a reasonable accommodation during the application process, reach out to support@micro1.ai.

Our hiring process utilizes artificial intelligence tools to assist in candidate screening and assessment. Our AI tools are designed to complement, not replace, human decision-making.

Disclaimer

The information contained in this job posting, including but not limited to role responsibilities, qualifications, compensation, and benefits, is provided for informational purposes only and does not constitute a binding offer of employment. micro1 reserves the right to amend, modify, or withdraw any portion of this posting at its sole discretion and without prior notice. All employment decisions are made in accordance with applicable laws and regulations.', '["Python", "LLMs", "AWS", "LangChain", "FastAPI"]', '["Build and improve AI agent capabilities using modern LLMs.", "Develop backend services and APIs in Python.", "Design and iterate on prompts, workflows, RAG, and agent orchestration.", "Evaluate model performance and continuously improve quality through experimentation.", "Collaborate with product and engineering teams to deliver AI-powered features.", "Deploy and maintain scalable AI systems in production.", "Stay current with the latest AI models, tools, and best practices.", "What We''re Looking For"]', 'open', '2026-10-06 01:05:40', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/7c09cefc-fd08-4ee4-b792-48e3a4753e9c?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
