Role Type: Contractor

Location: Remote

micro1 is engaging Art Related Professionals to contribute to a dynamic customer project focused on curation and evaluation of aesthetic visual content. In this role, you''ll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. This is a unique opportunity for visually discerning individuals to influence AI models by selecting and critiquing images for their artistic quality, originality, and visual impact.

