Strong written and verbal communication skills, with an emphasis on providing constructive and detailed feedback.
Previous experience in roles requiring critical evaluation or selection of images or visual content.
Up-to-date awareness of visual trends, cultural references, and emerging aesthetics in design or photography.
Self-motivated and able to consistently meet project deliverables in a remote engagement setting.', '["visual curation", "artistic judgment", "image evaluation", "written communication", "collaboration", "photography", "art direction", "graphic design", "illustration", "visual trend awareness"]', '["Review curated collections of filtered aesthetic images and assess each for superior visual quality and creative value.", "Apply advanced judgment to select images demonstrating exceptional composition, lighting, color, styling, originality, and technical execution.", "Document and articulate the reasoning behind your selections and critiques using clear written feedback.", "Collaborate with project trainers and other visual specialists to calibrate and align on quality standards.", "Maintain consistency and high standards when evaluating diverse visual genres and formats."]', 'open', '2026-10-06 00:05:43', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/9ca6654e-b787-4571-9d2e-ef5bbb9ad2c7?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
