Role Type: Contractor

Location: Remote

micro1 is looking for an experienced Audio Editing & Production Expert with strong hands-on experience using Audacity to support an AI training project.

In this role, you will use Audacity to complete real-world audio editing tasks, record your screen, and explain your workflows step by step. Your expertise will help improve how AI systems understand and perform audio-related tasks.

Scope of Work

Perform audio editing and production tasks using Audacity.
Work on audio trimming, mixing, noise reduction, and sound enhancement.
Demonstrate real-world Audacity workflows through screen recordings.
Clearly explain and document each step of your audio editing process.
Review audio-related tasks and provide feedback to support AI model improvement.
Ensure accuracy and quality in all completed tasks.

Preferred Qualifications

Strong hands-on experience using Audacity for professional audio editing or production.
Previous Human Data experience, such as data annotation, labeling, RLHF, or AI model evaluation.
Must have access to Audacity and be comfortable recording and sharing your screen.
Good understanding of audio editing, mixing, noise reduction, and audio file formats.
Ability to explain technical workflows clearly.
