Location: Fully remote, worldwide

You’ll need:  Professional experience creating or directing brand, marketing or social media creative for a company, agency or client

Your tasks: Review creative work and briefs, judge quality, brand fit and platform fit, and explain your decisions in writing

You’ll review marketing and social media creative work and judge it: what is working, what isn’t, and why. This is a good fit if you work as a brand creative, creative strategist, art director, social media creative or content lead and make decisions about what gets published.

