Ability to explain complex mechanical concepts clearly in written and spoken English.
Strong attention to detail and the ability to develop precise, technically correct solutions.

Nice to Have

Experience with FreeCAD.
Experience teaching, mentoring, or reviewing mechanical design work.
Professional CAD certifications, such as CSWP or CSWE.
