- Provide clear, concise written feedback on detected issues, ensuring accuracy in your descriptions.

- Participate in iterative review cycles, revisiting images and adjusting feedback based on evolving project guidelines.

- Collaborate through written and verbal channels for clarification, discussion, and knowledge sharing as needed.

- Maintain profile information to support project tracking and communication.

Preferred Qualifications

- Demonstrated background in graphic design, photography, digital imaging, photo editing, or a related creative discipline.

- Exceptional eye for detail and a meticulous, methodical working style.

- Strong written English skills, with the ability to communicate findings clearly, free from spelling or grammar errors.

