Role Type: Contractor

Location: Remote

micro1 is engaging Healthcare Attorneys with BigLaw experience to collaborate on healthcare regulatory and compliance projects for a valued customer. In this role, you''ll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.

Scope of Work

Review and annotate legal documents related to healthcare regulations, ensuring accuracy and clarity of regulatory concepts.
Analyze complex healthcare policies, statutes, and regulations, including HIPAA, Stark Law, and the Anti-Kickback Statute.
Draft and refine contract language to ensure compliance with U.S. healthcare legal frameworks.
Provide detailed feedback on regulatory compliance issues and identify potential legal risks in provided scenarios.
Contribute to the development of AI training data by offering expert commentary and nuanced legal interpretations.
Collaborate with project stakeholders to discuss findings and clarify healthcare legal concepts as needed.

Preferred Qualifications

Juris Doctor (JD) degree and active bar admission in the United States.
Substantial experience practicing healthcare law at a major U.S. law firm (BigLaw) or top healthcare-focused firm.
Demonstrated expertise in U.S. healthcare regulatory compliance, including HIPAA, Stark Law, and Anti-Kickback Statute.
Proven ability to review, annotate, and draft complex legal documents related to healthcare law and policy.
Strong written and verbal communication skills, with attention to detail and an analytical mindset.
Experience providing advisory services on healthcare compliance matters.
Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a remote project-based environment.', '["healthcare law", "regulatory compliance (e.g., hipaa, stark law, anti-kickback statute)", "legal document review and annotation", "policy analysis", "contract drafting", "written communication", "verbal communication", "attention to detail", "collaboration", "us healthcare regulatory knowledge"]', '["Review and annotate legal documents related to healthcare regulations, ensuring accuracy and clarity of regulatory concepts.", "Analyze complex healthcare policies, statutes, and regulations, including HIPAA, Stark Law, and the Anti-Kickback Statute.", "Draft and refine contract language to ensure compliance with U.S. healthcare legal frameworks.", "Provide detailed feedback on regulatory compliance issues and identify potential legal risks in provided scenarios.", "Contribute to the development of AI training data by offering expert commentary and nuanced legal interpretations.", "Collaborate with project stakeholders to discuss findings and clarify healthcare legal concepts as needed."]', 'open', '2026-10-22 01:20:30', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/f1bc4dbe-39df-4aa5-ac08-fc3e41c40fb1?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
