Transition to annotation of video frames as the project evolves and expands in scope.
Document and communicate any ambiguous cases or guideline questions clearly, demonstrating strong written and verbal skills.

Preferred Qualifications

U.S. citizenship and ability to obtain a DoD Common Access Card (CAC) or willingness to engage in the sponsorship process.
Demonstrated attention to detail and consistency performing repetitive, accuracy-critical tasks.
