Background in intelligence analysis or experience within the Intelligence Community considered a strong asset.
Master’s degree in a relevant field, such as national security, defense studies, or engineering, is desirable.', '["Naval domain depth", "Classified-environment fluency", "Stakeholder navigation", "Analytical judgment", "Briefing to leadership"]', '["Develop and deliver expert analysis on naval operations, platforms, and doctrine based on direct fleet, program, or intelligence experience."]', 'open', '2026-10-28 19:26:11', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/ec344a27-5e27-48e8-a713-63336f5951a3?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
