Minimum submission requirements apply. Experts must submit a minimum number of tasks per week.

Start Timeline & AvailabilityWe typically fill roles within 48 hours and are looking for experts who are ready to begin immediately. If selected, you will be expected to start your first tasks within 24–48 hours of completing onboarding.', '["Python3", "JAVA", "Rust", "Basics C++", "Typescript", "GoLang"]', '["Apply verified knowledge in Python3, JAVA, Rust to benchmark AI solutions", "Audit generative model outputs for technical and factual correctness", "Synthesize domain feedback and evaluation signals to improve model performance", "Collaborate with project coordinators to maintain high rubric adherence"]', 'open', '2026-09-16 16:28:30', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/18a809aa-0b7f-4523-ac0e-508c9f0f6f66?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
