Proactive approach to problem-solving and a commitment to high-quality, real-world accuracy in all deliverables.', '["Retail"]', '["Review, analyze, and provide feedback on simulated retail scenarios and operational workflows to ensure authenticity and accuracy."]', 'open', '2026-10-14 12:42:19', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/678001af-5fc0-4173-8320-3b0dc183651d?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
