4+ years hands-on in SaaS revenue, sales, CS, or implementation operations — not adjacent or management-only exposure.
Direct CRM ownership (Salesforce, HubSpot, or similar) with configuration experience, plus two or more connected tools: billing, CPQ, ticketing, or project tracking.
Track record of resolving policy conflicts and explaining tradeoffs, ideally in fintech, healthtech, insurtech, or complex multi-product environments.
Able to explain your reasoning clearly to technical and non-technical audiences.

