Hands-on work with real-time tracking, event streams, or activity monitoring systems.
Familiarity with OS-level APIs for capturing user/system interactions.
Deep understanding of performance optimization in desktop environments.
Strong debugging skills and ability to reason about edge cases in distributed/offline systems.

Preferred

Experience building productivity, monitoring, or telemetry-driven applications.
Knowledge of native OS integrations (permissions, background processes, system hooks).
Understanding of security and privacy considerations in user activity tracking.
Familiarity with auto-update systems and release management in Electron.', '["Electron.js", "Typescript", "Node.js", "Cross-platform Apps"]', '["Apply verified knowledge in Electron.js, Typescript, Node.js to benchmark AI solutions", "Audit generative model outputs for technical and factual correctness", "Synthesize domain feedback and evaluation signals to improve model performance", "Collaborate with project coordinators to maintain high rubric adherence"]', 'open', '2026-10-29 04:01:53', '2026-11-05T00:36:27.000Z', 'https://jobs.micro1.ai/post/8c0ddeba-5240-4059-9e61-544dd2c8292f?referralCode=a462a1ef-5825-41db-8422-83628df889fc&utm_source=referral&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=job_referral');
