micro1 is engaging Venture Capital & Corporate Attorneys to participate in a project focused on supporting a global customer with complex legal and transactional needs. In this role, you''ll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. The engagement offers a unique opportunity for legal professionals to influence the development of advanced technology by leveraging their specialized experience in venture capital transactions, corporate law, and strategic business guidance.

