• Trainer and QA communication: Update trainers and QAs on Discord about new item guidelines, project changes, workflow updates, and quality expectations.
• Question handling: Respond to trainer/QA questions clearly and promptly, especially around Bulgarian wording, grammar, Cyrillic script, register, translation fidelity, cultural context, terminology, and edge cases.
