This role is with SME Careers, a fast-growing AI Data Services company and subsidiary of SuperAnnotate, delivering training data for many of the world’s largest AI companies and foundation-model labs. Your ClickUp expertise directly helps improve the world’s premier AI models by teaching them how real users complete practical project-management, admin, operations, and team-collaboration workflows.


