• Classify annotated elements according to project guidelines.
• Ensure bounding boxes are tight, accurate, and follow annotation standards.
• Maintain correct reading order and logical structure across document elements.
• Handle complex layouts including multi-column text, forms, tables, and rotated pages.
• Follow detailed annotation instructions and apply rules consistently across all tasks.
• Identify and flag unclear cases or guideline gaps to supervisors.
• Maintain confidentiality and adhere strictly to data security policies.


### Requirements & Qualifications
• Bachelor’s degree (any field; preference for Technology, Engineering, or Data-related disciplines).
• 6 months – 2+ years of experience in data annotation, labeling, or similar roles (preferred but not mandatory).
• Strong attention to detail and ability to follow complex annotation guidelines.
• Basic understanding of document structures (text blocks, tables, forms, figures, etc.).
• Ability to interpret and apply rules related to bounding boxes, classification, and reading order
• Comfortable working with repetitive tasks while maintaining high accuracy.
• Familiarity with annotation tools or platforms is a plus.


### Eligible Countries (6)
Bangladesh, India, Indonesia, Pakistan, Thailand, The Philippines', '["Text Data Annotation", "PDF Bounding Box"]', '["Annotate PDF documents by drawing precise bounding boxes around entities such as text, tables, figures, captions, headers, and key-value structures.", "Classify annotated elements according to project guidelines.", "Ensure bounding boxes are tight, accurate, and follow annotation standards.", "Maintain correct reading order and logical structure across document elements.", "Handle complex layouts including multi-column text, forms, tables, and rotated pages.", "Follow detailed annotation instructions and apply rules consistently across all tasks.", "Identify and flag unclear cases or guideline gaps to supervisors.", "Maintain confidentiality and adhere strictly to data security policies."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', 'https://sme.careers/apply?referral=rp--66f070&jobId=ab1c3cb5-b8b7-4198-b524-9dd34c7f31fa&jobPostingId=PDF-102');
