• Strong understanding of relevant software workflows, including layers, groups, shapes, paths, scale, alignment, dimensions, exports, layouts, annotations, file formats, and visual organization.
• Ability to ensure your setup supports the task, including having the required programs installed, files/assets available, references prepared, and any necessary tools ready before recording.
