### Responsibilities
• Spot-check Excel/spreadsheet items and provide feedback through DMs.
• Review AI-generated formulas, spreadsheet workflows, financial models, data-cleaning steps, pivot-table guidance, charts, and explanations.
• Communicate guideline changes and Excel-specific standards on Discord.
