• Document task context: Provide enough task context, steps, goals, project details, files, and notes so reviewers can understand what the task is and how it was completed.
• Demonstrate practical software use: Complete workflows involving Firebase Console navigation, Authentication, Firestore, Realtime Database, Storage, Hosting, security rules, deployments, or troubleshooting where relevant.
• Maintain submission quality: Review your recording and documentation before submission to ensure the task is complete, understandable, realistic, safe, and aligned with project guidelines.


