• Reliable, self-directed, and able to deliver consistent quality in an hourly, remote contractor workflow across time zones.
• Additional professional skills are appreciated, including web development, mobile development, backend development, cloud, JavaScript, Flutter, QA, DevOps, or other computer-based workflows.


