ild scalable QA processes for mathematics AI training projects."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', 'https://sme.careers/apply?referral=rp--66f070&jobId=d6b4295f-ad66-4a94-951f-9b25a23b17cc&jobPostingId=MATHQAL-25-501');
