uring, equipment, structural integrity, or operational safety may be affected.", "Process improvement: Identify recurring quality gaps, propose workflow improvements, and help build scalable QA processes for mechanical engineering AI training projects."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', 'https://sme.careers/apply?referral=rp--66f070&jobId=8969e8f7-eeee-439e-b39b-8693f0b45d36&jobPostingId=MechanicalQAL-25-777');
