• Demonstrate practical software use: Complete workflows involving database creation, collections, CRUD operations, filtering, indexing, aggregation basics, data import/export, Compass navigation, or troubleshooting where relevant.
• Maintain submission quality: Review your recording and documentation before submission to ensure the task is complete, understandable, realistic, safe, and aligned with project guidelines.


### Requirements & Qualifications
