• Deep understanding of Persian grammar, spelling conventions, punctuation, Persian script, right-to-left formatting, ezafe, verb forms, word order, tone, and style—able to explain why something is wrong and how to fix it.
• Comfortable handling multiple registers and varieties, including formal Persian, conversational Persian, Iranian Persian, Dari, Tajik-related variation, professional, educational, and public-facing Persian, depending on audience and project requirements.
