• Question handling: Respond to trainer/QA questions clearly and promptly, especially around Punjabi wording, register, translation fidelity, cultural context, dialect variation, Gurmukhi/Shahmukhi script requirements, and edge cases.
• Trainer/QA activation management: DM contributors who are inactive or not working, encourage activation, track follow-ups, and flag availability issues when needed.
