• Demonstrate practical software use: Complete workflows involving coding, debugging, run configurations, virtual environments, terminal commands, Git integration, package installation, or test execution where relevant.
• Maintain submission quality: Review your recording and documentation before submission to ensure the task is complete, understandable, realistic, and aligned with project guidelines.


