• Prior experience with AI data training/annotation, translation QA, editorial QA, localization QA, or rubric-based evaluation is strongly preferred.', '["Style", "Copyediting", "Translation Quality Review", "Localization", "Slovenian", "Fact-Checking", "Keywords", "Tone & Register", "English", "Proofreading", "Cultural Context", "Grammar"]', '["Develop AI Training Content: Create prompts and gold-standard Slovenian answers across multiple domains, including general knowledge, customer support, education, conversational writing, translation, localization, and culturally sensitive content.", "Optimize AI Performance: Evaluate and rank AI outputs to improve fluency, correctness, tone match, register consistency, meaning preservation, terminology quality, and cultural appropriateness.", "Ensure Model Integrity: Detect unsafe or misleading content, factual hallucinations, bias, mistranslations, ambiguity, policy-risk language, and culturally inappropriate phrasing; validate reliability across use cases."]', 'open', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', '2026-11-04T21:29:05.827928Z', 'https://sme.careers/apply?referral=rp--66f070&jobId=d6c6bedb-c977-444f-b5b3-b04d4fce787d&jobPostingId=Slovenian-26-195');
