• Preferred: Merged pull requests in Swift/iOS open-source projects, competitive programming exposure, or similar evidence of strong algorithmic problem-solving skills.
• Experience reviewing app logic or mobile architecture, with previous AI data training or model evaluation work strongly preferred, and Minimum C1 English proficiency.


